{{also|bahn}}
==German==

===Etymology===
{{etymon|de|id=lane|inh|gmh>ban>|tree=0}}
From {{inh|de|gmh|ban}}, from {{inh|de|goh|*bana}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*banu}}, ultimately from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*banō}}. Cognate with {{cog|lb|Bunn}}, {{cog|nl|baan}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/baːn/}}
* {{audio|de|De-at-Bahn.ogg|a=Austria}}
* {{audio|de|De-Bahn.ogg}}
* {{homophones|de|Bahren|Barren|qq2=some speakers chiefly in casual speech}}
* {{rhymes|de|aːn|s=1}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f}}

# [[route]], [[trail]]
#: {{ux|de|Sie bricht sich ihre eigene '''Bahn'''.|translation=She blazes her own '''trail'''.}}
# {{lb|de|rail transport}} [[railway]]/[[railroad]] or [[rail transport]]
#: {{ux|de|Ich habe eine Tageskarte für Bus und '''Bahn'''.|translation=I've got a day ticket for bus and '''rail'''.}}
# {{short for|de|Eisenbahn}} a vehicle in rail transport ({{ng|especially a regional commuter train or tram, otherwise more often {{m|de|Zug}} or {{m|de|Tram}}}})
#: {{ux|de|Die '''Bahn''' kommt immer zu spät!|translation=The '''train''' is always late!}}
#: {{ux|de|Ich bin <u>in</u> der '''Bahn'''.|I'm on the '''train.'''}}
# {{lb|de|informal}} {{short for|de|Autobahn}}
#: {{ux|de|Ich bin <u>auf</u> der '''Bahn'''.|I'm on the '''motorway'''.}}
# {{lb|de|informal}} {{short for|de|Fahrbahn|t=lane [of a road]}}
# A large, wide [[sheet]] of [[material]] used for [[waterproof]]ing [[roof]]s and other [[structure]]s; [[waterproofing]] [[membrane]]
# {{lb|de|astronomy}} [[orbit]]
#: {{ux|de|Kometen umlaufen die Sonne auf exzentrischen '''Bahnen'''.|translation=Comets orbit the Sun on eccentric '''orbits'''.}}

